Roberts) The Democrats\u2019 aim to keep their message positive featured; details given of the unification of the Democratic Party to take back the White House. \n (Boston: Dan Rather) CBS coverage of the convention noted.", "segment_duration": 250, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760724, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "8dBfHOqac1", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "September 11 / Commission Report / Recommendations", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) Report introduced. \n (Washington: Jim Stewart) The change in President Bush\u2019s position marked by his decision to adopt some of the reforms recommended by the committee that investigated the September 11 attacks featured; scenes shown of National Security Advisor Condoleezza Rice arriving at Bush\u2019s ranch in Crawford, Texas; details given of the pressure from the 9/11 Committee for Bush to move quickly; recommendations needing presidential action and those requiring Congressional action outlined. [Thursday, Senator John KERRY \u2013 endorses the recommendations.] [Sunday, 9/11 Commission vice chairman Lee HAMILTON&#134;- notes some of the recommendations can be done by executive order.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760725, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "62FdqXdcJB", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Iraq / Unrest / Security", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) A car bombing in Iraq and the release of an Egyptian diplomat by militants who had threatened to kill him reported.   (Kadimiyah: Kimberly Dozier) The progress of Iraqi security forces examined; videos shown of 2 Jordanian drivers who were kidnapped today and 2 Pakistani hostages; scenes shown of Iraqi police on patrol in the Kadimiyah&#134;&#134; neighborhood of Baghdad, backed up by US troops; details given of the US military\u2019s appeal to religious leaders to back Iraqi security forces. [1st Cavalry Division Lt. Scott CHALKLEY&#134;- says they want to make their streets safer.] [Iraqi MAN \u2013 says the people are looking forward to the policemen.]", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63440.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760726, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "dpl12raZSY", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items; fallen soldier Army 1st Lt. Todd Bryant&#134<!-- spelling on screen --> profiled. (Studio: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63560.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760727, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "3uRUyQZ64m", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Prilosec; Oral-B; Allegra; Unisom; Neosporin; Plavix.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "63610.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760728, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "P0C9eZrw3n", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Inside Story (Clinton)", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) The views of Senator Hillary Clinton about her role at the Democratic National Convention, her political future, and rumors of a rivalry between her & Senator John Edwards presented. [CLINTON \u2013 supports Senator John Kerry as an alternative to President Bush; comments on talk that she considered running for president herself; expresses support for both Kerry & Edwards; says the Bush administration has been a setback for the world.]", "segment_duration": 190, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63760.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760729, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "tBnqH0Bb0D", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Computers: Virus, Google", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) A computer worm that disrupted service on the Internet, including the Website for Google, which revealed the price of its upcoming IPO, reported.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63950.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760730, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "YvOsaHMvw9", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Boston: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63970.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760732, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names