 (Stun Guns)", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) Report introduced.   (Bloomington, Indiana: Wyatt Andrews) Continuing questions about the safety of electric stun guns, or Tasers, which are intended to be a non-lethal substitute for firearms, examined; details given about the death of prisoner James Borden after being shot with a Taser in an Indiana jail, and about increasing numbers of Taser-related deaths; video shown of officer David Shaw\u2020\u2020 shooting Borden. [Coroner Dr. Roland KOHR\u2020\u2020- says the Taser is responsible for triggering Borden\u2019s death.] [Taser International CEO Rick SMITH\u2020\u2020- says the Taser has not caused a death; states Kohr\u2019s findings were disputed by his medical experts.]   (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 160, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64150.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760734, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "AYp5ZfM3tj", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Massachusetts / Child Divorce Case", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) The agreement by teenager Patrick Holland\u2020\u2020\u2019s father, who is serving time for murdering his wife, to Holland\u2019s request to end all parental rights reported. \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64310.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760735, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "1TRkZRo7rM", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Boston: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64330.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760736, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "CDlAygugOG", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "(Commercial: \"CBS Evening News\"; L.L. Bean; Singulair; Expedia.com; Mylanta; NewsChannel 5.)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 180, "segment_type_id": 3, "segment_start_time": "64350.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760737, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Commercial", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "HGILXijSju", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "The week\u2019s upcoming stories previewed (Boston: Dan Rather)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64530.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760738, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 760723, "segment_id": "igLNMW4b36", "segment_broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "segment_title": "Political Conventions", "segment_description": "(Boston: Dan Rather) Report introduced.   (Boston: Jim Axelrod) The purpose of political conventions, where every moment seems to be scripted and the outcome is known, examined. [\u201cCBS News\u201d analyst Harrison HICKMAN&#134;- says it\u2019s an infomercial.] [Actor Richard DREYFUS&#134;- explains why he is at the convention.] [Senator John Kerry\u2019s campaign manager Mary Beth CAHILL&#134;- says you have the absolute attention of the country focused on you.]", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64560.0", "legacy_segment_id": 760739, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "Mds1CUJo0H", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_i